/.vscode
/node_modules
/dist

# Environment files anywhere in the monorepo — keep real secrets out of git.
# .env.example templates stay tracked.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Markdown notes/reviews/planning docs — keep local for now.
# Only README files stay tracked (project + codebase-review index).
*.md
!README.md
!**/README.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!ARCHITECTURE.md
!ROADMAP.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!HANDOVER.md
!.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md
!.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/*.md

# Word docs (specs/feature notes) — keep local.
*.docx

# Local dev run logs and helper (transient)
*-dev.out.log
*-dev.err.log
RUN_FULL_APP_COMMANDS.txt
